{"id":"paperback-chic","title":"Paperback Chic","url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Paperback_Chic","rev":239787,"fetched":"2026-10-16","lead":[{"t":"p","c":[{"t":"b","c":["Paperback Chic"]}," is a simplified design style prevalent between the late 2010s and present that features natural, soft colors, playful or retro airy layouts and display fonts that gives modern product labeling/packaging and branding a friendly, wholesome, and artistic paperback-book look where they appear everywhere from trendy food package labels to wellness drinks. It is often used by cafes and organic food brands to appeal to a general market."]}],"sections":[{"title":"Visuals","id":"visuals","blocks":[{"t":"ul","items":[{"c":["Matte textures that are meant to feel tactile, organic, and down-to-earth."]},{"c":["Lots of white space with friendly, hand-drawn, or simple illustrations"]},{"c":["retro serif, wavy, or didone display typefaces that influence a vintage-styled look."]},{"c":["Earthy creams, warm pastel tones, sage greens, and muted terracotta."]}]}]},{"title":"Media","id":"media","blocks":[{"t":"h","l":3,"c":["Brands"]},{"t":"ul","items":[{"c":["Craftmix"]},{"c":["Rite N' Lite"]},{"c":["Chobani"]},{"c":["Olipop"]},{"c":["Gelato Fiasco"]},{"c":["La Canette"]},{"c":["Core & Rind"]},{"c":["Onda"]},{"c":["Kindfull"]},{"c":["Meridian"]},{"c":["Spindrift"]}]}]},{"title":"Gallery","id":"gallery","blocks":[{"t":"gallery","items":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/e/e9/EyJidWNrZXQiOiJhcmVuYV9pbWFnZXMiLCJrZXkiOiIxNDIyNjA2NS9vcmlnaW5hbF9mMDU4N2FlN2I1MjBlYTFjMTVlNmM4MWQwNjljZm...9LCJmbGF0dGVuIjp7ImJhY2tncm91bmQiOnsiciI6MjAzLCJnIjoyMDMsImIiOjIwM319LCJqcGVnIjp7InF1YWxpdHkiOjc1fSwicm90YXRlIjpudWxsfX0%3D.webp/revision/latest?cb=20260816131042","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/c/c3/EyJidWNrZXQiOiJhcmVuYV9pbWFnZXMiLCJrZXkiOiIxNDIyNjE0Ny9vcmlnaW5hbF9kNjUxOTlhYTNmY2I3MWNmODZlNjFlYzE1OGIyZj...9LCJmbGF0dGVuIjp7ImJhY2tncm91bmQiOns